---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PhiMark from '../components/PhiMark.astro';
import { BOOKING_URL, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Phronimos"
  description="Phronimos comes from the Greek word for practical wisdom. We build managed AI workforces that help businesses operate more intelligently, founded by Matthew Kirby in San Diego."
>
  <section class="section-tight page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <hr class="rule" data-reveal />
      <h1 data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 1">Practical wisdom, applied to operations.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section name-story">
    <div class="container name-grid">
      <div class="mark-block" data-reveal>
        <PhiMark size={120} />
      </div>
      <div class="name-copy" data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 1">
        <h2>The name</h2>
        <p>
          Phronimos comes from the Ancient Greek <em>φρόνιμος</em>: prudent, practically wise,
          exercising sound judgment. It is the adjectival form of <em>phronesis</em>, Aristotle's
          word for practical wisdom. Knowing not just what is true, but what to do.
        </p>
        <p>
          The letter that opens the name, phi, is also the symbol of the golden ratio: the
          classical proportion associated with balance and sound structure. That is the brand's
          argument in a single glyph. Intelligence in the right proportion, applied with judgment.
        </p>
        <p class="muted pronounce">Pronounced FRAH-nih-mos.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section why">
    <div class="container why-inner">
      <h2 data-reveal>Why Phronimos exists</h2>
      <div class="prose" data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 1">
        <p>
          Phronimos was founded on a simple conviction: most businesses are full of valuable people
          spending their time on work that is repetitive, mechanical, or inefficient. The
          opportunity is not to replace them with flashy AI. It is to design creative, scalable
          solutions to real operational problems, so owners and their teams are freed to do more
          interesting, creative, and valuable work.
        </p>
        <p>
          That motivation sets the center of gravity. Phronimos is not fascinated by the technology
          for its own sake. It is fascinated by the problem: the bottleneck, the inefficiency, the
          thing that should not take a person eight hours. And by the elegance of a solution that
          quietly makes it disappear.
        </p>
        <p>
          This is why the work values judgment over novelty and reliability over hype. The measure
          is whether the business runs better, not whether the demo impressed anyone.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section principles">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 data-reveal>Operating principles</h2>
      <ul class="principles-grid">
        <li data-reveal>
          <h3>Practical wisdom first.</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            Every system is judged by the quality of its decisions. If a simpler approach produces
            a sounder result, that is the more intelligent approach.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 1">
          <h3>Reliability is the product.</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            A digital teammate that works most of the time is a liability. We optimize for
            consistent, supervisable execution over peak-case brilliance.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 2">
          <h3>Solve the business problem.</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            Start from the bottleneck and work backward. The technology is a means; the operational
            outcome is the point.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 3">
          <h3>Leverage, not replacement.</h3>
          <p class="muted">
            Success looks like a team doing more of what matters, not a smaller org chart.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section founder">
    <div class="container founder-inner">
      <h2 data-reveal>The founder</h2>
      <div class="prose" data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 1">
        <p>
          Phronimos is founded and led by <strong>Matthew Kirby</strong>, based in San Diego,
          California. Matthew works hands-on with every client: running the audits, building the
          operators, and managing the systems that stay live. The delivery infrastructure behind
          Phronimos is the same discipline sold to clients, with monitoring, failure alerts, and
          documented playbooks for everything that runs.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section final-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="display" data-reveal>See it applied to your operations.</h2>
      <div class="cta-actions" data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 1">
        <a href={BOOKING_URL} class="btn btn-primary">Book the AI Workflow Audit</a>
        <span class="muted">or write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head h1 {
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    max-width: 24ch;
  }

  .name-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 9fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .mark-block {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .name-copy p {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .pronounce {
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .why {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface-raised);
  }

  .why-inner .prose {
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }

  .principles-grid {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: var(--space-7) 0 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-7) var(--space-8);
  }

  .principles-grid h3 {
    font-size: 19px;
  }

  .principles-grid .muted {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }

  .founder {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .founder-inner .prose {
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }

  .final-cta .display {
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    margin-top: var(--space-7);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .name-grid,
    .principles-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .mark-block {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
